-- INDEPENDENT TESTS for row IL-26 (BACKLOG IL-56), by fid-il-26.
-- Every expected value is from DECIDED-ANSWERS.md (sha256 cbaad463574eb9ca9b9d526b0b61d76f67af77e3c64c46ed71550acd55aff314),
-- written from the Hebrew sources before this encoding was opened. Case ids (A09, E04, ...) are that file's.
-- No expected value was changed to match the encoding.
-- A plain #ASSERT that refuses is counted by check.sh as refused and is declared there, by id and class.

§ `Independent tests`

§§ `Fixtures`

GIVEN card IS A BOOLEAN
      other IS A BOOLEAN
      addl IS A BOOLEAN
      f0130 IS A BOOLEAN
      told IS A BOOLEAN
      p IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `The employee's declarations`
`independent: declarations` card `,` other `,` addl `,` f0130 `,` told `, points` p MEANS
    `The employee's declarations` WITH
        `gave the employer an employee's card (form 0101)`                                    IS card
        `filled in the section of the card on other income`                                    IS other
        `declared on the card an additional position, or a taxable pension from another payer` IS addl
        `declared on form 0130 that there is no other taxable income`                          IS f0130
        `told the employer of other taxable income after making that declaration`              IS told
        `credit points claimed on the card`                                                    IS p
        `date of birth`                                                                        IS YMD 1990 1 1

`independent: ordinary card, 2.25` MEANS `independent: declarations` TRUE `,` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `, points` 2.25
`independent: no card` MEANS `independent: declarations` FALSE `,` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `, points` 2.25
`independent: card without other-income section` MEANS `independent: declarations` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `, points` 2.25
`independent: declared additional position` MEANS `independent: declarations` TRUE `,` TRUE `,` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `, points` 2.25
`independent: form 0130` MEANS `independent: declarations` TRUE `,` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` TRUE `,` FALSE `, points` 2.25
`independent: form 0130 then other income` MEANS `independent: declarations` TRUE `,` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` TRUE `,` TRUE `, points` 2.25
`independent: additional position and form 0130` MEANS `independent: declarations` TRUE `,` TRUE `,` TRUE `,` TRUE `,` FALSE `, points` 2.25

GIVEN s IS A NUMBER
      part IS A NUMBER
      days IS A NUMBER
      hd IS A NUMBER
      hw IS A NUMBER
      pension IS A BOOLEAN
      y IS A NUMBER
      work IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A payment of salary`
`independent: payment of salary` s `, part paid` part `, days` days `, hours a day` hd `, hours a week` hw `, pension` pension `, paid in` y `, for` work MEANS
    `A payment of salary` WITH
        `tax year`                                                                       IS y
        `the tax year for which the salary is paid`                                      IS work
        `the month's salary`                                                             IS s
        `the part of the month's salary paid in this payment`                            IS part
        `days worked in the month`                                                       IS days
        `hours worked a day`                                                             IS hd
        `hours worked a week`                                                            IS hw
        `the payment is a pension`                                                       IS pension
        `the employee is a foreign worker`                                               IS FALSE
        `the employee works elsewhere, or receives a taxable pension from another payer` IS FALSE

GIVEN s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A payment of salary`
`independent: additional-position payment` s MEANS
    `A payment of salary` WITH
        `tax year`                                                                       IS 2026
        `the tax year for which the salary is paid`                                      IS 2026
        `the month's salary`                                                             IS s
        `the part of the month's salary paid in this payment`                            IS s
        `days worked in the month`                                                       IS 22
        `hours worked a day`                                                             IS 8
        `hours worked a week`                                                            IS 40
        `the payment is a pension`                                                       IS FALSE
        `the employee is a foreign worker`                                               IS FALSE
        `the employee works elsewhere, or receives a taxable pension from another payer` IS TRUE

GIVEN s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A payment of salary`
`independent: full month` s MEANS
    `independent: payment of salary` s `, part paid` s `, days` 22 `, hours a day` 8 `, hours a week` 40 `, pension` FALSE `, paid in` 2026 `, for` 2026

`independent: figures 2026` MEANS `the annual figures published for tax year` 2026
`independent: figures by hand` MEANS
    `The annual figures for the tax year` WITH
        `the amount in section 121B(a) in force in the tax year` IS 721_560
        `the value of one credit point` IS 2_904
`independent: default readings` MEANS `the readings of the withholding rules, by default`

-- Withholding of a payment for a declaration set, 2026, default readings, no direction.
GIVEN pay IS A `A payment of salary`
      d IS AN `The employee's declarations`
GIVETH AN EITHER `A problem with the payment, for the withholding rules` NUMBER
`independent: withholding` pay `given` d MEANS
    `the withholding on` pay `given` d `with` `independent: figures 2026` `reading` `independent: default readings` `under the direction` `no direction`

-- A month's salary s, 2026, with p points, ordinary card.
GIVEN s IS A NUMBER
      p IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN EITHER `A problem with the payment, for the withholding rules` NUMBER
`independent: tax on` s `with points` p MEANS
    `independent: withholding` (`independent: full month` s) `given` (`independent: declarations` TRUE `,` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `, points` p)

GIVEN b IS A NUMBER
      bankrupt IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A non-regular salary`
`independent: non-regular salary` b `, bankrupt` bankrupt MEANS
    `A non-regular salary` WITH
        `amount` IS b
        `paid to the employees of a bankrupt or a company in liquidation` IS bankrupt

GIVEN b IS A NUMBER
      bankrupt IS A BOOLEAN
      s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`independent: bonus` b `, bankrupt` bankrupt `, on salary` s MEANS
    `regulation 4(a) — the tax on` (`independent: non-regular salary` b `, bankrupt` bankrupt) `paid with a month's salary of` s `in` 2026 `for` (`independent: declarations` TRUE `,` TRUE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `,` FALSE `, points` 2.25) `with` `independent: figures 2026` `reading` `independent: default readings`

§§ `A. Schedule A, ordinary monthly salary, 2.25 points (A01-A24)`

