-- A25-A28: other tax years. The encoding refuses 2025 and 2023 (IL-03 prints section 121 for 2026-2027 only); class SCOPE.
#ASSERT `the withholding on` (`independent: payment of salary` 10_000 `, part paid` 10_000 `, days` 22 `, hours a day` 8 `, hours a week` 40 `, pension` FALSE `, paid in` 2025 `, for` 2025) `given` `independent: ordinary card, 2.25` `with` `independent: figures by hand` `reading` `independent: default readings` `under the direction` `no direction` EQUALS RIGHT 575 -- A25
#ASSERT `the withholding on` (`independent: payment of salary` 20_000 `, part paid` 20_000 `, days` 22 `, hours a day` 8 `, hours a week` 40 `, pension` FALSE `, paid in` 2025 `, for` 2025) `given` `independent: ordinary card, 2.25` `with` `independent: figures by hand` `reading` `independent: default readings` `under the direction` `no direction` EQUALS RIGHT 2_995 -- A26
#ASSERT `the withholding on` (`independent: payment of salary` 25_000 `, part paid` 25_000 `, days` 22 `, hours a day` 8 `, hours a week` 40 `, pension` FALSE `, paid in` 2025 `, for` 2025) `given` `independent: ordinary card, 2.25` `with` `independent: figures by hand` `reading` `independent: default readings` `under the direction` `no direction` EQUALS RIGHT 4_647 -- A27
#ASSERT `the withholding on` (`independent: payment of salary` 10_000 `, part paid` 10_000 `, days` 22 `, hours a day` 8 `, hours a week` 40 `, pension` FALSE `, paid in` 2023 `, for` 2023) `given` `independent: ordinary card, 2.25` `with` `independent: figures by hand` `reading` `independent: default readings` `under the direction` `no direction` EQUALS RIGHT 616 -- A28
-- A29, A30: 2028 and 2022 need the published figure.
#ASSERT REFUSED `the annual figures published for tax year` 2028 BECAUSE "no annual figures published by the Israel Tax Authority for this tax year have been sourced in this encoding" -- A29
#ASSERT REFUSED `the annual figures published for tax year` 2022 BECAUSE "no annual figures published by the Israel Tax Authority for this tax year have been sourced in this encoding" -- A30
-- 2027 is the same table (M01 neighbour).
#ASSERT `the withholding on` (`independent: payment of salary` 10_000 `, part paid` 10_000 `, days` 22 `, hours a day` 8 `, hours a week` 40 `, pension` FALSE `, paid in` 2027 `, for` 2027) `given` `independent: ordinary card, 2.25` `with` (`the annual figures published for tax year` 2027) `reading` `independent: default readings` `under the direction` `no direction` EQUALS RIGHT 575

§§ `B. Credit points (B01-B08)`

